{
  "id": "443",
  "title": "The Missing Money",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-02-07",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming tries to prove that he didn't take money from his mom.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/637/9f746a8dc81b10120449deb664d2ff28f19ebe7b.mp3?1515696410",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "钱不见了\n\n    小明妈妈的钱不见了，她觉得是小明偷的。小明怎么说都没用，妈妈还是觉得钱是小明偷的。\n    小明没办法了，指着灯说：“要是我真的偷了钱，这个灯马上就会灭。”\n    刚说完，灯就灭了。\n    小明心想：“不会吧！”\n    他正要和妈妈解释，灯又亮起来了。然后，他看见爸爸在那儿摁着开关说：“怎么样？小明！好玩吗？”",
    "traditional": "錢不見了\n\n    小明媽媽的錢不見了，她覺得是小明偷的。小明怎麼說都沒用，媽媽還是覺得錢是小明偷的。\n    小明沒辦法了，指著燈說：“要是我真的偷了錢，這個燈馬上就會滅。”\n    剛說完，燈就滅了。\n    小明心想：“不會吧！”\n    他正要和媽媽解釋，燈又亮起來了。然後，他看見爸爸在那兒摁著開關說：“怎麼樣？小明！好玩嗎？”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The money is missing"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明妈妈的钱不见了，她觉得是小明偷的。",
      "traditional": "小明媽媽的錢不見了，她覺得是小明偷的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma de qián bú jiàn le tā jué de shì xiǎo míng tōu de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "小明怎么说都没用，妈妈还是觉得钱是小明偷的。",
      "traditional": "小明怎麼說都沒用，媽媽還是覺得錢是小明偷的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng zěn me shuō dōu méi yòng mā ma hái shi jué de qián shì xiǎo míng tōu de",
      "english": "Little Ming's mom's money was missing, and she believed it was Little Ming who took it."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It didn't matter what Little Ming said, mom still believed it was Little Ming who took the money."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小明没办法了，指着灯说：",
      "traditional": "小明沒辦法了，指著燈說：",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng méi bàn fǎ le zhǐ zhe dēng shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“要是我真的偷了钱，这个灯马上就会灭。”",
      "traditional": "“要是我真的偷了錢，這個燈馬上就會滅。”",
      "pinyin": "yào shi wǒ zhēn de tōu le qián zhè ge dēng mǎ shàng jiù huì miè",
      "english": "Little Ming was at a loss and pointed at the lamp saying:"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“If it was really me who stole the money, may this lamp go out right now.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "刚说完，灯就灭了。",
      "traditional": "剛說完，燈就滅了。",
      "pinyin": "gāng shuō wán dēng jiù miè le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "As soon as he finished talking, the lamp went out."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明心想：“不会吧！”",
      "traditional": "小明心想：“不會吧！”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xīn xiǎng bú huì ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming thought to himself: “No way!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "他正要和妈妈解释，灯又亮起来了。",
      "traditional": "他正要和媽媽解釋，燈又亮起來了。",
      "pinyin": "tā zhèng yào hé mā ma jiě shì dēng yòu liàng qǐ lái le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "然后，他看见爸爸在那儿摁着开关说：",
      "traditional": "然後，他看見爸爸在那兒摁著開關說：",
      "pinyin": "rán hòu tā kàn jiàn bà ba zài nà'r èn zhe kāi guān shuō",
      "english": "He was just about to explain to his mom when the lamp turned on again."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "“怎么样？小明！好玩吗？”",
      "traditional": "“怎麼樣？小明！好玩嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "zěn me yàng xiǎo míng hǎo wán ma",
      "english": "Then he noticed his dad over there pressing the light switch saying:"
    }
  ],
