    "sentence_translations": [
      "The money is missing",
      "",
      "Little Ming's mom's money was missing, and she believed it was Little Ming who took it.",
      "It didn't matter what Little Ming said, mom still believed it was Little Ming who took the money.",
      "",
      "Little Ming was at a loss and pointed at the lamp saying:",
      "“If it was really me who stole the money, may this lamp go out right now.”",
      "",
      "As soon as he finished talking, the lamp went out.",
      "",
      "Little Ming thought to himself: “No way!”",
      "",
      "He was just about to explain to his mom when the lamp turned on again.",
      "Then he noticed his dad over there pressing the light switch saying:",
      "“What do you think? Little Ming! Was it funny?”"
    ]
  }
